=1721106229\" width=596 height=42 /></span><br>Nearly every move in the game can be countered with a well-timed parry.<br>Punches, kicks, sword slashes, bullets, balls of concentrated ki, even explosions can be swiftly deflected if your timing is right.<br>If you have the meter for it, you can even parry out of hit stun, for high-stakes reversals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389140/extras/f122672879ef32949c5787baab4016c0.webp?t=1721106229\" width=596 height=42 /></span><br>Great for parties! Four players can play two simultaneous matches with the winners facing off seamlessly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389140/extras/75e37da0f630527a69a50cbf1449abc4.webp?t=1721106229\" width=596 height=42 /></span><br>Both two-player and four-player tag-team modes are available for some chaotic fun! <br>Lots of interesting character combinations to play around with.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389140/extras/df8359fc00fcb168356a4d57ed848c95.webp?t=1721106229\" width=596 height=42 /></span><br>Team Battle is also available!! Put your matchup knowledge to the test in 3v3 duels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389140/extras/1ee8c05e0c4076adf151f9bd09671118.webp?t=1721106229\" width=596 height=42 /></span><br>Movelists are small yet impactful, matches are quick, and characters have clearly defined win conditions.<br>Swordmin'z Dream's <strong>Mini-Maximalist</strong> ethos means each design element is a small idea taken to a logical extreme.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389140/extras/6918832